{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep2/quest_story/12227020.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1222702001:0":{"text":"あそこにいるのは、ソヨゴ学会の学者さんじゃないですか？","source_cn":"前面那位不是冬青学会的学者吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B181C8A0C3D037F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1222702002:0":{"text":"何か探してるみたいだけど……困っているようなら力になってあげましょう！","source_cn":"他好像在找什么东西……我们过去帮帮忙吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52398943D794DF67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep2/quest_story/12227030.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1222703001:1":{"text":"何かお探しですか？手伝えることはありますか？","source_cn":"你在找什么呀？需要帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ABB28B04A41DA86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222703002:1":{"text":"えっ、本当に！こんな辺鄙な場所で、あなた方のような親切な人たちに出会えるなんて！","source_cn":"噢，太好了！没想到这么偏僻的地界还能遇到好心人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBDB0CEA5AE6BF30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222703003:1":{"text":"このカバンも寿命かな。見てくださいよこの穴。知らない間に金貨がこぼれたみたいで、今探してるんです。","source_cn":"你们瞧瞧，我这包背了太久，一不注意竟然破了个洞，包里的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84CFCA212DE82E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222703004:1":{"text":"はぁ、半年かけて貯めた金貨が……もし見つからなかったら、<style=\"highlight\">ゴールドグッピー</style>が釣れない！","source_cn":"唉，这些金币可是我攒了大半年的……要是找不回来，我今天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C8F12CBB33C6A37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222703004":{"text":"はぁ、半年かけて貯めた金貨が……もし見つからなかったら、<style=\"highlight\">ゴールドグッピー</style>が釣れない！","source_cn":"唉，这些金币可是我攒了大半年的……要是找不回来，我今天铁定钓不上<style=highlight>黄金孔雀</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C8F12CBB33C6A37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222703005:1":{"text":"ゴールドグッピーのことをご存じない？あのシレーヌに匹敵する貴重な魚なんですよ！","source_cn":"……你们连黄金孔雀都不知道？那可是能和冥湾美人齐名的珍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB24B5D9EDDC0A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222703007:1":{"text":"いや！シレーヌ以上の、伝説のキングフィッシュと言って差し支えないでしょう！","source_cn":"不！应该说，它是比冥湾美人更稀奇的、传说中的鱼王！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0166149F73543FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222703008:1":{"text":"そ、そんな大げさな……","source_cn":"有、有这么夸张吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E618D3233B9BDA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222703009:1":{"text":"ハハハ。まぁ真実か否かは、釣り上げれば分かりますよ。","source_cn":"哈哈，事实如何，总得先钓上来才能一探究竟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C7534B2D062B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222703010:1":{"text":"そして熟練漁師たちによると、ゴールドグッピーの生息地はラスティーアンカー海域のみで、<style=\"highlight\">夕暮れから夜にかけてのみ</style>現れるそうです。","source_cn":"那些老渔夫们说，整个伊索米亚大陆上只有锈锚港这片水域里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F729FAA0E7267B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222703011:1":{"text":"最も驚くべきことは、金貨しか食べないそうなので、純金の見た目をしているということです！いったいどれほどの価値があることか！","source_cn":"最稀奇的是，据说它只吃金子，所以看起来也像是纯金打造的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D88FED6991BDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222703012:1":{"text":"どこかで聞いたような話ですね……","source_cn":"好熟悉的说法，我们是不是在哪里听说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB147F2C4598B94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222703013:1":{"text":"あっ！ロワンさんのアヒル、ブラドック一世ですよ！たしか、金貨を食べて純金の卵を産むという伝説がありましたよね！","source_cn":"啊！是罗万的鸭子，布拉达克一世吧？传说中会吃金币产金蛋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56B2E3B383A9559D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222703014:1":{"text":"それはオシドリだね、ロンロン。","source_cn":"是姝鸯啦，满满。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x736BE0E1CC3C2E57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222703015:1":{"text":"なんと……生のオシドリを見たことが！？\n後で鳥類を研究している同僚に教えなければ。","source_cn":"……什么，你们见过活的姝鸯？！\\n回头我得转告我那个研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C72870944CF2EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1222703015":{"text":"なんと……生のオシドリを見たことが！？\n後で鳥類を研究している同僚に教えなければ。","source_cn":"……什么，你们见过活的姝鸯？！\\n回头我得转告我那个研究鸟类的同事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C72870944CF2EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222703016:1":{"text":"……失礼な！私の研究のためだ！","source_cn":"……我是为了研究！研究！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8704DBEE27C21B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222703017:1":{"text":"自慢するわけではないですが、魚の研究において、ソヨゴ学会で私の右に出る者はいません。","source_cn":"不是我自夸，在研究鱼类这方面，要是我自称第二，冬青学会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15912044FD0F5F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222703019:1":{"text":"おっと、こんなこと話してる場合じゃない。助けてくれるのなら、一緒に金貨を探してください！","source_cn":"哎哟，没空聊这些了。快帮我找找掉出去的金币吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x275273CF7F71CFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222703020:1":{"text":"一枚でも多くの金貨が見つかれば、それだけゴールドグッピーが釣れる確率も高まる！！","source_cn":"多一枚金币，就多一分钓上黄金孔雀的可能性！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4FEFF16C5C5F526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"それで、お金のために釣りを？","source_cn":"你钓鱼是为了卖钱？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD32D4C8F1F0B4405","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それで、お金のために釣りを？","female":"それで、お金のために釣りを？","variant_male_record_index":"67472","variant_female_record_index":"67473","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222703018:1":{"text":"仕方ない。それも研究のためです。","source_cn":"没办法，为了学术研究嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF038582EE9B79F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti